=== E4 container 1x1
HYPOTHESIS: PNG signature, IHDR(13: w,h BE, 08 02 00 C0 DE), one IDAT (zlib), IEND; CRC-32/IEEE over type+data
  hex: 89 50 4e 47 0d 0a 1a 0a 00 00 00 0d 49 48 44 52 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 08 02 00 c0 de 3a e6 7b 43 00 00 00 0c 49 44 41 54 78 9c 7b 20 a8 64 0c 00 04 2e 01 47 0a 2e c3 21 00 00 00 00 49 45 4e 44 ae 42 60 82
  chunks: [(b'IHDR', 13), (b'IDAT', 12), (b'IEND', 0)] IHDR: 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 08 02 00 c0 de
  IDAT starts 789c (zlib CMF/FLG 78 9c = deflate, 32K window, default level)
  inflated: e0 11 22 33
RESULT: CONFIRMED - 1 filter byte + 3 residual bytes; all filters equal X when neighbours are 0, tie -> first filter (0xE0)

